      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "Scale: \n- 10B web pages\n- 2MB per page avg.\n- 5 days to scrape\n- unlimited resources (within reason)\n\nNon-functional Requirements:\n- Fault tolerant\n- Politeness\n- Scale to 10B pages \n- Efficiently crawl in under 5 days",
