      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "400Gbps 2MB per page\n\n400Gbps / 8bits/byte / 2MB/page = 25k pages/s\n\n~30%\n\n25k pages/s * .3 = 10k\n\n10^10 / 10^4 = 10^6 seconds\n10^6 / 10^5 = 10\n\n2 machines * 2 = 4 machines",
